        [
          "Attribute",
          "description",
          [
            "Heredoc",
            [
              "EOT",
              "\nList of additional container registry endpoints for pulling custom artifacts (WASM modules, graph definitions, connector templates).\nMCR (mcr.microsoft.com) is always added automatically with anonymous authentication.\n\nThe `acr_resource_id` field enables automatic AcrPull role assignment for ACR endpoints\nusing SystemAssignedManagedIdentity authentication. When `should_assign_acr_pull_for_aio` is true\nand `acr_resource_id` is provided, the AIO extension's identity will be granted AcrPull access to the specified ACR.\n"
            ]
          ]
        ],
